OL,3,AEurope ready for talks with Russia on
OL,4,Aending war in Ukraine, leaders say
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean leaders have said they are
OL,7,Fready for negotiations with Russia on
OL,8,Fending the war in Ukraine, in a strong
OL,9,Fshow of support for Kyiv.
OL,11,F"Europe has a clear and consistent and
OL,12,Funited negotiating position," UK Prime
OL,13,FMinister Andy Burnham said, while
OL,14,FGerman Chancellor Friedrich Merz
OL,15,Fstressed that Moscow's "maximalist
OL,16,Fdemands are not realistic".
OL,18,FThey were speaking at Berlin's summit
OL,19,Fof Ukraine's allies known as the
OL,20,FCoalition of the Willing.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
