OL,3,AEurope ready for talks with Russia on
OL,4,Aending war in Ukraine, leaders say
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's envoys were
OL,7,Falso there, and his son-in-law Jared
OL,8,FKushner said Trump wanted to make a
OL,9,Fdeal with Russia "with Europe by his
OL,10,Fside". Russia's Vladimir Putin has so
OL,11,Ffar rejected any European role in the
OL,12,FUS led peace talks.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
